	<infoGroup name="Lore of The Deep" hidden="false" id="5b5f-acf0-7c9-33b6">
      <comment>Lore of Magic</comment>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Raise Dead" typeId="8232-ae14-b1f6-b4df" typeName="Spell" hidden="false" id="4ee2-60-e41c-708e">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Number" typeId="8a2b-690b-e552-6aa0">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="c2ca-5fd1-5e9d-bc90">Enchantment</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="d84d-3b8b-654a-9e1a">10+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="1043-a0ad-2909-dd28">12</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="64ba-31-acf0-5a">Place a unit of 2D3 Risen Zombies on the battlefield anywhere completely within 12&quot; of this model, but not within 1&quot; of any enemy models. This unit cannot declare a charge during the turn in which it was raised.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Kiss Of The Deep" typeId="8232-ae14-b1f6-b4df" typeName="Spell" hidden="false" id="7356-68b4-107d-2dff">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Number" typeId="8a2b-690b-e552-6aa0">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="c2ca-5fd1-5e9d-bc90">Magical Vortex</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="d84d-3b8b-654a-9e1a">6+/8+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="1043-a0ad-2909-dd28">15</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="64ba-31-acf0-5a">If this spell is cast with a casting result of 8 or more, the target friendly unit gains a +D3 modifier to one of the following characteristics (to a maximum of 10). If this spell is cast with a casting result of 12 or more, the target friendly unit gains a +D3 modifier to two of the following characteristics (to a maximum of 10). This spell lasts until your next Start of Turn sub-phase.Remains in Play. If this spell is cast with a casting
result of 7 or more, place a small (3") blast template so that
its central hole is within 15" of the caster. If this spell is cast
with a casting result of 8 or more, place a large (5") blast
template so that its central hole is within 15" of the caster.
Whilst in play, the template does not move and is treated
as a water terrain feature. Enemy units treat the water
terrain as dangerous terrain, and any unit (friend or foe)
with the Flaming Attacks special rule within the water
terrain loses the Flaming Attacks special rule, unless they
also have the Magical Attacks special rule. </characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Dead Eye" typeId="8232-ae14-b1f6-b4df" typeName="Spell" hidden="false" id="f806-9fb-d767-14b7">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Number" typeId="8a2b-690b-e552-6aa0">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="c2ca-5fd1-5e9d-bc90">Enchantment</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="d84d-3b8b-654a-9e1a">7+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="1043-a0ad-2909-dd28">12</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="64ba-31-acf0-5a">A target friendly unit gains a +D3 modifier to their
Ballistic Skill characteristic (to a maximum of 10). This
spell lasts until your next Start of Turn sub-phase. </characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </infoGroup>
           </sharedInfoGroups>
